## Build

```bash
# Regular build (dynamically linked)
go mod tidy
go build ./...

# Fully static binaries (recommended for deployment)
CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -ldflags '-extldflags "-static"' -o ltaped ./cmd/ltaped
CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -ldflags '-extldflags "-static"' -o ltape  ./cmd/ltape
```

